    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5aec455738c194783140184",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，可是――有人说过很『期待』花瓶里的花――\n花坛那边，也差不多\n该好好打理一下了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f4761ab5d2ecfaf91391ad53fbac49d0a43e978e2b62a6e7f4ce90770b1475a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
