      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，可是……要是继续恶化下去，\n又让大家担心的话――\n但是……呜呜……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a9c27c8bfc71bd218e47d2bee0835d39661330181a48a12ebe7d32c6e4fe36e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
