      "uid": "zhcn:1497933e0e411253e3aeb34b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "幽灵先生现在――身形非常高大，\n呈现出漆黑的模样……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a369a0dda546af941c915799cb86aed29ffcd6c3af12a8ca2bdb60a43ab3bae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
