    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c544c9c970ead815e60a3c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天，我想照料一下花朵，\n所以早早就来了。\n毕竟我是美化委员――",
      "source_fingerprint": "69269b2c084139902df836af55115fa34859f048407f7814892c1bc9592451c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0594624d36ba64828219f462",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她真是仔细思考过每一种搭配啊）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c5cdafd3b78da379e803fb84bb5c8bd279d6cf6c0e5eb5440da865a791eb991",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
